\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Let Him to whom we now belong
\par His sovereign right assert,
\par And take up every thankful song
\par And every loving heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. He justly claims us for His own,
\par Who bought us with a price;
\par The Christian lives to Christ alone,
\par To Christ alone he dies.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, Thine own at last receive,
\par Fulfil our heart's desire,
\par And let us to Thy glory live
\par And in Thy cause expire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our souls and bodies we resign:
\par With joy we render Thee
\par Our all, no longer ours, but Thine
\par To all eternity.
\par         Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

